  "description": "The itc TS-0300M is a conference Controller from itc's Wireless Conference Systems range, built for council chambers, boardrooms, government and university meeting halls, courts and conference centres.\n\nKey figures: simultaneous interpretation channel 63+1 channels; frequency response 80~16KHz; touch screen 4.3-inch fu×olor touch screen. Highlights include 3. Built-in DSP processor and 4. Supports two recording methods.\n\nAudioVisual Nepal designs, supplies and commissions itc conference systems across Nepal — from municipal board rooms to assembly chambers — with training and local after-sales support.",
