  "description": "The itc TS-0300GU is a full digital conference system controller from itc's Digital Conference Systems range, built for council chambers, boardrooms, government and university meeting halls, courts and conference centres.\n\nKey figures: frequency response 80 HZ ~16KHz; touchscreen control 2.0 inch TFT LCD screen.\n\nAudioVisual Nepal designs, supplies and commissions itc conference systems across Nepal — from municipal board rooms to assembly chambers — with training and local after-sales support.",
