    "title": "It features built-in dual-ring dual-link backup",
    "desc": "It features built-in dual-ring dual-link backup, eliminating the need for additional expansion equipment. When one link in the conference unit fails, the backup link can be automatically switched in milliseconds , ensuring the continuity and stability of system operation."
