  "description": "The itc TS-0400MX is a full-Digital Smart Conferencing Network Audio Processor from itc's Digital Conference Systems range, built for council chambers, boardrooms, government and university meeting halls, courts and conference centres.\n\nKey figures: frequency response ±1dB 20Hz~20KHz; display screen 2.0-inch TFT LCD screen. Highlights include it features an 8-in.\n\nAudioVisual Nepal designs, supplies and commissions itc conference systems across Nepal — from municipal board rooms to assembly chambers — with training and local after-sales support.",
